  "decision_rule": "The profile length at each probe window must equal that window's label count minus 20, and must equal the number the design states for that window, which is 120, 180 or 260. Each window must also yield a label window whose profile can be detrended at degree 2 and can carry a period of 4 or more at two or more whole cycles, under both labellings. A token count enters its window only with at least 40 training positions. Anything else is CALIBRATION_UNUSABLE and halts before any held-out number is computed.",
